<title>USA: Johnson Worldwide buys kayak maker.</title>
<headline>Johnson Worldwide buys kayak maker.</headline>
<dateline>RACINE, Wis. 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Johnson Worldwide Associates Inc, which makes diving, fishing and camping equipment, said Tuesday it acquired Ocean Kayak Inc, a Ferndale Wash.-based manufacturer of sit-on-top kayaks.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Ocean Kayak's revenues in 1996 totaled $5.7 million.</p>
<p>The acquisition will give Johnson Worldwide canoe and kayak manufacturing capability on the West Coast.</p>
<p>			 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
